sentences.l:
“Stranger, since indeed you ask me these things and inquire,
this house was once set to be wealthy and blameless,
as long as that man was still at home;

on his way back from Ephyra, from Ilus son of Mermerus —
for Odysseus had gone there too, on a swift ship,
seeking a man-slaying drug, so that he might have it
to smear his bronze-fitted arrows;

but he did not
give it him, since he held in awe the gods who are forever,
but my father gave it him;

But truly these things lie on the knees of the gods,
whether he will return and exact payment, or not,
in his own halls;

The suitors bid scatter, each to his own,
and your mother, if her heart urges her to marry,
let her go back to the hall of her father, great in power;

sentences.t:
ἢ οὐκ ἀίεις οἷον κλέος ἔλλαβε δῖος Ὀρέστης
πάντας ἐπ’ ἀνθρώπους, ἐπεὶ ἔκτανε πατροφονῆα,
Αἴγισθον δολόμητιν, ὅ οἱ πατέρα κλυτὸν ἔκτα;

sentences.l:
And the gift, whatever your dear heart bids you give me,
give it on my coming back again, for me to carry home,
picking out a very fine one;
